e pronta!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Dimmi, dimmi!
Non importa.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hmm... Not workin' for ya?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well, that's that then.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}We'll just stick with {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, I
